# Dino Game

### About

In this project, I got myself an Arduinio Mega 2560 R3 Board running on ~10 MHz which is not necessarily fast but
it is cheap & a challenge for me to work even with some limitations. Additionally, I have a shield - an Arduino 2.8" TFT LCD Touchscreen!

So with that, I decided to do some applications on it to see if it works. So I put it into test and wanted to recreate the dino game from Google Chrome Offline
on it. Let's say it was not that straight forward and different than OpenGL on PC. You have to get used to the fact that you cannot clear the background each frame since it looks really weird because it is just too slow. Still I managed to make this + source code in the /sketch folder!
